WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.325
Review your LaTeX beside the PDF, with suggestions you control.

00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:10.186
Preview a suggestion in the PDF before changing the draft.

00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:16.502
Accept a few precise corrections. Your draft updates immediately.

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:21.714
Switch the PDF pane to Changes PDF. All three columns stay in place.

00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:29.001
See your revisions in the typeset paper: deleted wording struck out, new wording underlined.

00:00:31.100 --> 00:00:35.594
Press Why for the reason behind a change, without losing your place in the paper.

00:00:36.100 --> 00:00:41.074
Switch to Clean paper to read the revised version without the deletion markup.

00:00:42.100 --> 00:00:44.863
Save your work. The manuscript stays clean.
